<h1>Finishing</h1>

<p>Finishing lines at Wrexham and Poznan cover shot blasting, powder coating, zinc plating and passivation. Most parts are finished immediately after machining, so a component can leave the group as a single order rather than passing through separate subcontractors.</p>

<p>Coating thickness and adhesion are checked against the customer specification before parts are packed, and records are kept alongside the casting and machining traceability for the same part number. Where a customer specifies an external finish standard, such as a particular paint system or plating class, our finishing team works from that specification directly.</p>

<p>Finishing normally follows on from <a href="/products/castings">casting</a> and <a href="/products/machining">machining</a>; see either page for the earlier stages of production.</p>
